  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.3: the token's environment name (e.g. Dev, Staging, Prod) is available as configuration[\"IodreamVault:Environment\"] when the token shares it. 1.0.2: only the token is needed: AddIodreamVault(token). 1.0.0: first public release. Loads an app's secrets for the token's environment; optional Section, App (for All apps tokens), Optional and ReloadInterval. Targets .NET 8, 9 and 10.",
